/**
 * Every principal phase of 2026, for `phase-event.test.ts`.
 *
 * - `eventDate` is the local calendar date of the phase instant.
 *
 * - `post` says which day carries the post: `same` for the event's own date,
 *   `prev` for the day before.
 *
 * - `dateTime` is the instant itself, from `pnpm horizons <eventDate>`, which
 *   interpolates the crossing to well under a second. The doc's Time column is
 *   the same data truncated to the whole minute, so it is not the source here.
 */
